# Root .gitignore — added after credential-bearing build artifacts were
# found tracked (see GOAL_PROMPT_NOTES.md, credential-purge goal).
# Build outputs must never be committed: a production JS bundle carried a
# read-write Turso token into git history.

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
node_modules_bak/

# ── Build artifacts (JS bundles carry inlined secrets) ───────────────────────
# Bundle names are matched as BARE FILENAMES, not pinned paths. The leaked
# token rode out in a bundle, and `--bundle-output` puts the file wherever the
# caller asks — a path-pinned rule only covers the one default location and a
# bundle emitted at the repo root or under GroceryApp/ escapes it entirely.
GroceryApp/dist-android/
index.android.bundle
index.ios.bundle
*.hbc
*.jsbundle
dist/
.expo/
web-build/

# ── Local environment (never commit real DSNs/tokens) ────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.*.local

# ── Secrets by file class ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Whole classes of credential-bearing files, ignored by extension so a new one
# is covered the moment it lands — nothing here should ever reach a commit.
# Signing material (keystores, provisioning profiles, App Store Connect keys)
# is provisioned through EAS/CI secrets, never through the tree.
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
# Exception: the Android *debug* keystore is the well-known public one shipped
# with the SDK (password "android"). It is already tracked and must stay
# tracked so debug builds share a signature; it holds no secret.
!GroceryApp/android/app/debug.keystore

# ── Store submission credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# eas.json points submit.production.android at
# ./credentials/play-service-account.json. That file is a Google service-account
# key with upload rights to the Play listing, and it is JSON — so none of the
# by-extension rules above would have caught it.
credentials/
*play-service-account*.json
*.p8.json

# ── Keys (generated locally, provisioned via deploy env) ─────────────────────
relay-server/keys/

# ── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# console login captures + editor workspace — never commit
GroceryApp/test_screenshots/*-login.png
.qoder/

# ── Agent/tool scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.impeccable/
